   "en": "⟦0⟧ is a middle-sized country in South America with a population of ⟦1⟧. It borders ⟦2⟧ and ⟦3⟧ to the north, ⟦4⟧ to the west, ⟦5⟧ to the east and ⟦6⟧ to northeast. Argentina's terrain is dominated by plains and deserts. Although it starts out relatively weak, as the largest and arguably second strongest nation in South America besides Brazil, it's in a prime position to expand into its many weaker neighbors and dominate the continent.",
